{"seq":3,"slug":"entity-resolution","title":"实体解析协议与 \\_entities 查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/foundations/entity-resolution","wordCount":709,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"实体解析协议与-_entities-查询\">实体解析协议与 _entities 查询</h1><p>Federation 指令在 schema 层面声明了类型的所有权和依赖关系，但这些声明如何在运行时生效？答案是实体解析协议——一套由 Router 和子图共同遵守的通信契约。它定义了 Router 如何通过 <code>_entities</code> 查询向子图&quot;按 key 查实体&quot;，以及子图如何用 reference resolver 返回对应数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>每个 Federation 兼容的子图都会自动暴露两个特殊根字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>调用方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>_service</code></td>\n<td>返回子图 SDL，供组合引擎获取 schema</td>\n<td>Rover CLI / 组合引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>_entities(representations: [_Any!]!)</code></td>\n<td>按 key 批量解析实体</td>\n<td>Router（运行时）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Router 将需要解析的实体打包成 representations 数组，每个 representation 包含 <code>__typename</code> 和 key 字段值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant R as Router&#10;    participant U as 用户子图&#10;    participant O as 订单子图&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;R: query { user(id:&quot;1&quot;) { name orders { total } } }&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: Query Planning&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;U: query { user(id:&quot;1&quot;) { __typename id name } }&#10;    U--&gt;&gt;R: { __typename:&quot;User&quot;, id:&quot;1&quot;, name:&quot;Alice&quot; }&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;O: _entities(representations:[{__typename:User,id:1}]) { orders { total } }&#10;    O--&gt;&gt;R: { orders: [{ total: 99.9 }] }&#10;    R--&gt;&gt;C: { user: { name:&quot;Alice&quot;, orders: [{ total: 99.9 }] } }\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant R as Router\n    participant U as 用户子图\n    participant O as 订单子图\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;R: query { user(id:\"1\") { name orders { total } } }\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: Query Planning\n    R-&gt;&gt;U: query { user(id:\"1\") { __typename id name } }\n    U--&gt;&gt;R: { __typename:\"User\", id:\"1\", name:\"Alice\" }\n    R-&gt;&gt;O: _entities(representations:[{__typename:User,id:1}]) { orders { total } }\n    O--&gt;&gt;R: { orders: [{ total: 99.9 }] }\n    R--&gt;&gt;C: { user: { name:\"Alice\", orders: [{ total: 99.9 }] } }</pre><h2 id=\"reference-resolver-实现\">Reference Resolver 实现</h2><p>子图侧每个实体必须提供 reference resolver——接收 representation 并返回实体实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const resolvers = {&#10;  User: {&#10;    __resolveReference(representation) {&#10;      return userService.findById(representation.id);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolvers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  User: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __resolveReference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">representation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(representation.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Rust async-graphql 中使用 <code>#[graphql(entity)]</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[Object]&#10;impl Query {&#10;    #[graphql(entity)]&#10;    async fn find_user_by_id(&amp;self, id: ID) -&gt; User {&#10;        user_repo.find(id).await&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[Object]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[graphql(entity)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn find_user_by_id(&#x26;self, id: ID) -> User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        user_repo.find(id).await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"批量解析与-n-1-防护\">批量解析与 N+1 防护</h2><p>Router 将同一子图的多个 entity 请求批量化为一次 <code>_entities</code> 调用。子图侧必须使用 DataLoader 批量查询：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>数据库查询</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素（逐个）</td>\n<td><code>SELECT ... WHERE id = $1</code>（N 次）</td>\n<td>灾难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DataLoader</td>\n<td><code>SELECT ... WHERE id IN ($1,$2,...)</code></td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const userLoader = new DataLoader(async (ids) =&gt; {&#10;  const users = await db.query(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ANY($1)&#39;, [ids]);&#10;  return ids.map((id) =&gt; users.find((u) =&gt; u.id === id));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userLoader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ANY($1)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [ids]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ids.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"_any-标量与-_entity-union\">_Any 标量与 _Entity Union</h2><p><code>_Any</code> 是任意 JSON 对象的标量类型，类型安全由组合引擎在构建时保证。<code>_Entity</code> union 自动包含子图中所有声明了 <code>@key</code>（<code>resolvable: true</code>）的实体类型，Router 使用内联片段指定要解析的类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"provides-减少-fetch-轮次\">@provides 减少 fetch 轮次</h2><p>当子图解析关联字段时能顺带返回额外信息，用 <code>@provides</code> 通知 Router 跳过额外 fetch：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type Order @key(fields: &quot;id&quot;) {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  product: Product! @provides(fields: &quot;name price&quot;)&#10;}&#10;type Product @key(fields: &quot;id&quot;) {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  name: String! @external&#10;  price: Float! @external&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Order @key(fields: \"id\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  product: Product! @provides(fields: \"name price\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Product @key(fields: \"id\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String! @external</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  price: Float! @external</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>_entities</code> 查询是 Router 与子图的跨服务数据获取协议</li>\n<li>Representation 包含 <code>__typename</code> + key 字段值</li>\n<li>Reference resolver 是子图的&quot;按 key 查数据&quot;入口，必须配合 DataLoader</li>\n<li><code>@provides</code> 有效减少不必要的跨子图 fetch 轮次</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"supergraph-architecture\">Supergraph 架构模型</a>——Router 与子图的整体职责划分</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../devops-tools/api-design/graphql/performance-patterns\">GraphQL 性能模式</a>——DataLoader 的实现原理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"高级-entity-解析模式\">高级 Entity 解析模式</h2><h3 id=\"复合键解析\">复合键解析</h3><p>当实体使用复合键（<code>@key(fields: &quot;sku storeId&quot;)</code>）时，representation 中包含多个字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{ &quot;__typename&quot;: &quot;Product&quot;, &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;ABC-123&quot;, &quot;storeId&quot;: &quot;store-01&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"__typename\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ABC-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"storeId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"store-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>reference resolver 需要同时使用两个字段进行查找。DataLoader 的 key 也需要是复合结构——推荐序列化为字符串 <code>&quot;sku:storeId&quot;</code> 作为 DataLoader 缓存 key。</p>\n<h3 id=\"嵌套键解析\">嵌套键解析</h3><p>Federation 支持嵌套对象作为 key（<code>@key(fields: &quot;address { zipCode }&quot;)</code>）。这在地理位置类实体中常见：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type Store @key(fields: &quot;address { zipCode countryCode }&quot;) {&#10;  address: Address!&#10;  name: String!&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Store @key(fields: \"address { zipCode countryCode }\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  address: Address!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>representation 会是嵌套结构：<code>{ &quot;__typename&quot;: &quot;Store&quot;, &quot;address&quot;: { &quot;zipCode&quot;: &quot;94105&quot;, &quot;countryCode&quot;: &quot;US&quot; } }</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不可解析实体-stub-entity\">不可解析实体（Stub Entity）</h3><p>当子图只需要引用另一个子图的实体作为关联字段的返回类型，但不需要解析该实体的任何字段时，使用 <code>resolvable: false</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type Product @key(fields: &quot;id&quot;, resolvable: false) {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Review {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  product: Product! # 引用但不解析&#10;  rating: Int!&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Product @key(fields: \"id\", resolvable: false) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Review {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  product: Product! # 引用但不解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rating: Int!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这避免了子图暴露不必要的 <code>_entities</code> 解析能力，保持关注点分离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"entity-interface\">Entity Interface</h3><p>Federation v2.3 引入 <code>@interfaceObject</code>，允许一个子图将接口定义为&quot;对象式实体&quot;，简化跨子图的多态类型处理。这在&quot;媒体库&quot;类场景（文章、视频、播客共享基础字段但各有扩展）中特别有用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实体解析协议与 \\_entities 查询","id":"实体解析协议与-_entities-查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Reference Resolver 实现","id":"reference-resolver-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"批量解析与 N+1 防护","id":"批量解析与-n-1-防护"},{"level":2,"text":"\\_Any 标量与 \\_Entity Union","id":"_any-标量与-_entity-union"},{"level":2,"text":"@provides 减少 fetch 轮次","id":"provides-减少-fetch-轮次"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"高级 Entity 解析模式","id":"高级-entity-解析模式"},{"level":3,"text":"复合键解析","id":"复合键解析"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套键解析","id":"嵌套键解析"},{"level":3,"text":"不可解析实体（Stub Entity）","id":"不可解析实体-stub-entity"},{"level":3,"text":"Entity Interface","id":"entity-interface"}],"prev":{"title":"Federation 指令体系与类型共享","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/foundations/federation-directives"},"next":{"title":"子图开发：多语言实现与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/subgraph-development"}}